	<ideo>
		<overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>The Resonance Chamber</overriddenWorshipRoomLabel>
		<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
			<def>Deity</def>
			<place>Oubanyen</place>
			<deities />
		</foundation>
		<name>The Absolute Frequency</name>
		<adjective>scoured</adjective>
		<memberName>Null-Acolyte</memberName>
		<leaderTitleMale>The Architect</leaderTitleMale>
		<leaderTitleFemale>The Architect</leaderTitleFemale>
		<description>The Absolute Frequency is the living manifestation of the Perfect Silence. All biological complexity is "noise" that must be harrowed until only a single, rhythmic Null-Thrum remains. The rim is is but a "stepping stone to the Perfect Silence," where flesh is merely raw material to be grafted, consumed, or unmade. 

In the shadow of the Sovereign Stillness, individuality collapses into a mindless unison, turning vibrant colonies into rhythmic, light-swallowing voids where the air itself refuses to carry a scream.</description>
		<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
		<culture>Kriminul</culture>
		<iconDef>ArchotechB</iconDef>
		<colorDef>DarkMauve</colorDef>
		<memes>
			<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
			<li>Raider</li>
		</memes>
